 glyph (2T)","Places a glyph-aura (2T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":4,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Places a start-of-turn glyph (2T)","Places a glyph-aura (2T)"]},{"grade":3,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Places a start-of-turn glyph (2T)","Places a glyph-aura (2T)"]}],"description":"Places a start-of-turn glyph that inflicts Fire damage on enemies.\nRemoves MP from enemies present in or entering the glyph.\n\nAlso summons the Shepherd's Lantern if the cell is free.\nPrevents the use of other elemental glyphs in the same turn."},{"id":13025,"name":"Lookout","element":"fire","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12181-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":7,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":10,"effects":[{"element":"fire","min":30,"max":34,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"fire","min":36,"max":41,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Dissipates glyphs","Places a glyph-aura (2T)"]}],"description":"Inflicts Fire damage on enemies in an area of effect and places a glyph-aura under the caster that increases allies' Range.\nThe glyph-aura is placed on the targeted cell if it is free or if the target is an ally.\n\nAlso summons the Shepherd's Lantern if the cell is free.\n\nPrevents the use of other elemental glyphs in the same turn.\nDissipates the spell's previously placed glyph-aura."},{"id":13020,"name":"Backup","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12174-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":2,"maxRange":4,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Teleports to the targeted cell"]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":2,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Teleports to the targeted cell"]},{"grade":3,"ap":2,"minRange":2,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Teleports to the targeted cell"]}],"description":"Teleports the caster to the targeted ally."},{"id":13027,"name":"Ataraxia","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12179-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":3,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["x25% damage sustained"]}],"description":"Applies the Gravity state on the targeted ally and reduces all types of damage suffered on the first attack.\nThe spell's effects are removed upon suffering any attack.\n\nInterception and damage-sharing effects are incompatible with the spell."},{"id":13011,"name":"Silbo","element":"air","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_13087-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":2,"critChance":10,"effects":[{"element":"air","min":13,"max":15,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":1,"max":1,"kind":"push"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"air","min":16,"max":18,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":2,"critChance":10,"effects":[{"element":"air","min":17,"max":19,"kind":"damage"},{"element":"neutral","min":1,"max":1,"kind":"push"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"air","min":20,"max":23,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Inflicts Air damage on enemies and pushes targets back from the centre in an area of effect.\nDoes not affect the caster."},{"id":13007,"name":"Shepherd's Crook","element":"fire","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12158-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":7,"maxPerTurn":3,"critChance":10,"effects":[{"element":"fire","min":18,"max":20,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"fire","min":22,"max":24,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Attracts by 3 cell"]}],"description":"Inflicts Fire damage on enemies and attracts the target."},{"id":14434,"name":"Torpor","element":"earth","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12152-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":1,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":3,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":22,"max":24,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":26,"max":29,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Attracts by 2 cell"]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":1,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":3,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"earth","min":27,"max":30,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"earth","min":32,"max":36,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Attracts by 2 cell"]}],"description":"Attracts the target and inflicts Earth damage on enemies."},{"id":29045,"name":"Getaway","element":"water","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_13086-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":1,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":3,"critChance":15,"effects":[{"element":"water","min":27,"max":29,"kind":"damage"}],"critEffects":[{"element":"water","min":32,"max":35,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Moves back 2 cell"]}],"description":"Moves the caster away from the target and inflicts Water damage on enemies."},{"id":12991,"name":"Into the Fold","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12154-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":2,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Places a glyph-aura (1T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":3,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Places a glyph-aura (1T)"]}],"description":"Places a glyph-aura that applies the Unshakable and Gravity states on entities.\nAlso applies the Shepherd's Star on allies present in or entering the glyph."},{"id":13024,"name":"Excursion","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12180-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Places a glyph-aura (1T)","Places a glyph (1T)"]}],"description":"Places a glyph that switches the allies' places with the caster's.\nAlso applies the Shepherd's Star on allies who trigger the glyph."},{"id":12988,"name":"Distrust","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_13216-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["10 Lock (1T)","Places an end-of-turn glyph (1T)","Places a glyph-aura (1T)"]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":7,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["15 Lock (1T)","Places an end-of-turn glyph (1T)","Places a glyph-aura (1T)"]}],"description":"Increases the targeted ally's Lock for each enemy adjacent to them, and places an end-of-turn glyph that inflicts Earth, Fire, Water and Air damage on enemies.\nIncreases the close-combat resistances of allies present in or entering the glyph.\n\nAlso summons the Shepherd's Lantern, applies the spell's effects on it and allows it to lock if the cell is free."},{"id":13019,"name":"Barrier","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12173-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Places a glyph (1T)","Places a glyph-aura (1T)"]}],"description":"Applies the Gravity and Barrier states to the target.\n\nOn an enemy:\n• At the start of their turn, places a glyph that inflicts Earth, Fire, Water and Air damage around the target.\n• Increases the ranged resistances of allies present in or entering the area of effect.\n• The glyph only inflicts damage on the enemy if they go through it.\n• The states and glyph are removed if the enemy goes through the Barrier or if they are killed.\n\nOn an ally:\n• The glyph is placed at end of the caster's turn and only inflicts damage on the first enemy that goes through it.\n• The states and glyph are removed if the target or an enemy goes through the Barrier.\n\nOn a free cell: summons the Shepherd's Lantern and applies the spell's effects on it."},{"id":12982,"name":"Feca Shield","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12156-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":4,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["x75% damage sustained"]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["x70% damage sustained"]}],"description":"Reduces damage suffered by the targeted ally.\nAlso applies the Shepherd's Star state to the targeted ally and all allies present in an allied elemental glyph."},{"id":12997,"name":"Reinforced Protection","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_14521-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":0,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[]}],"description":"Increases the caster's characteristics based on their active elemental armour, triggers their elemental glyphs on the targeted cell, and applies the Shepherd's Star on allies present in these glyphs.\n\nThe glyphs can only be triggered manually once per turn."}]}